#. 死体の傍に、
#. 焼け焦げた何かの破片が
#. 落ちていた。
#. 
#. また、モノクマから取り出した
#. 爆弾が体育館から消えていた。
#. 
#. それら２つは、明らかに
#. 関係していると思われる…
msgctxt "0125"
msgid ""
"There were bits of charred\n"
"debris near the body.\n"
"\n"
"It should be noted that the\n"
"bomb which had been removed\n"
"from Monokuma in the gym had\n"
"disappeared.\n"
"\n"
"It's hard to imagine these two\n"
"events are unrelated..."
msgstr ""

